<title>THAILAND: Unicord 1996 Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Unicord 1996 Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				  Third quarter</p>
<p>		   (millions baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	1.16	vs   Loss     1.10</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss    326.05	vs   Loss   306.94</p>
<p>				  Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	5.18	vs   Loss     2.64</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss  1,450.21	vs   Loss   738.17</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are consolidated. Unicord Plc is a canned seafood producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
